@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Monospaced
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Pathological resource-feedback chain

rectangle "External and protocol pressure" #BBDEFB {
  component "valid work arrivals" as Arrivals #64B5F6
  component "validator / infrastructure\nunavailability" as Outage #42A5F5
}

rectangle "Live protocol work" #FFE0B2 {
  component "admission queue\nand parent deferral" as Queue #FFB74D
  component "finality lag\nand catch-up" as Lag #FFA726
  component "replay, RSpace, caches,\nand task ownership" as Live #FB8C00
}

rectangle "Resource state" #FFCDD2 {
  component "resident-memory\nheadroom consumed" as RSS #EF5350
  component "resource guard\nterminates nodes" as Guard #E53935
}

rectangle "Service consequence" #D1C4E9 {
  component "eligible weight and\nservice capacity fall" as Capacity #9575CD
  component "service predicate lost" as Loss #7E57C2
}

Arrivals --> Queue
Outage --> Lag
Queue --> Live
Queue --> Lag : finalization falls behind
Lag --> Live
Live --> RSS
RSS --> Guard : guard reached
Guard --> Capacity
Capacity --> Queue : less service
Capacity --> Lag : slower catch-up
Capacity --> Loss
Queue --> Loss : cap reached
Lag --> Loss : SLO exceeded

note bottom of RSS #FFF9C4
The adverse envelope sets successful reclamation to zero.
This is a declared falsifier, not a measured current-branch rate.
end note
@enduml
